# 9:51 is "Have salt in yourselves, and have peace one with another" (KJV),
# the second half of 9:50. Where 9:44 and 9:46 are printed (LSG) they are the
# second halves of 9:43 and 9:45, better than going into hell whole; versions
# that omit them (RDV24, VIE1925) simply have no such verse.
MRK 9:1-43 = MRK 9:1-43
MRK 9:44 = MRK 9:43
MRK 9:45 = MRK 9:45
MRK 9:46 = MRK 9:45
MRK 9:47-50 = MRK 9:47-50
MRK 9:51 = MRK 9:50
